name competences
category Package
revision 47573
shortdesc Track skills of classroom checks
relocated 1
longdesc This package is an attempt to track skills assessed during a
longdesc classroom check. Each question can be associated with one or
longdesc more skills and be assigned a number of points to be earned. At
longdesc the end of the text, a table set summarizes the skills
longdesc assessed, and in what proportions.
